ring/ring.js includes a JavaScript version of MurmurHash3 (32-bit x86),
written by Austin Appleby and placed in the public domain, and a version of
the jump consistent hash algorithm described by John Lamping and Eric Veach
in "A Fast, Minimal Memory, Consistent Hash Algorithm" (2014).

revisions/kubernetes.js lists the fields of Kubernetes' API types. It is made
from the Kubernetes project's Go packages (k8s.io/api, k8s.io/apimachinery,
k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver and k8s.io/kube-aggregator), Copyright The
Kubernetes Authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

config/servers.js records facts about Redis and Valkey: each version's
settings with their names, types, limits and defaults, and the messages the
servers print. They were read from the servers' source code, Copyright
Redis Ltd. and the Redis contributors, and Copyright the Valkey contributors.
